# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Panoramica {#overview}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With SQOA Solver by JIJ, you can solve large combinatorial optimization problems on IBM&reg; quantum computers. The solver is based on the Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) [\\[1\\]](#references). Unlike quantum algorithms that use a one-to-one mapping between classical decision variables and qubits, SQOA Solver can handle optimization problems with more variables than the number of qubits available on current quantum devices. Its sampling-based design also makes it less sensitive to the physical noise on current quantum hardware. Together, these features make SQOA Solver well suited to optimization problems at this stage of quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Con SQOA Solver di JIJ puoi risolvere grandi problemi di ottimizzazione combinatoria sui computer quantistici IBM&reg;. Il solver si basa sul Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) [\\[1\\]](#references). A differenza degli algoritmi quantistici che usano una mappatura uno a uno tra variabili decisionali classiche e qubit, SQOA Solver è in grado di gestire problemi di ottimizzazione con più variabili del numero di qubit disponibili sugli attuali dispositivi quantistici. Il suo design basato sul campionamento lo rende inoltre meno sensibile al rumore fisico dell'attuale hardware quantistico. Insieme, queste caratteristiche rendono SQOA Solver adatto ai problemi di ottimizzazione in questa fase del calcolo quantistico.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The solver handles Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization (QUBO) problems given as a classical mathematical formulation, and it automatically maps the classical formulation into the quantum setting. You can also convert constrained problems into unconstrained ones by using the penalty method.\n"
msgstr "Il solver gestisce problemi di Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization (QUBO) forniti come formulazione matematica classica e mappa automaticamente la formulazione classica nel contesto quantistico. Puoi anche convertire problemi con vincoli in problemi senza vincoli usando il metodo della penalità.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following sections describe the solver's workflow and benchmark results. The [get started guide](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/jij-sqoa-solver/get-started) shows end-to-end examples that model problems with [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper) and, optionally, Open Mathematical prograMming eXchange (OMMX). [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) is an open data format and SDK that simplifies the exchange of optimization problems between software tools.\n"
msgstr "Le sezioni seguenti descrivono il flusso di lavoro del solver e i risultati dei benchmark. La [guida introduttiva](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/jij-sqoa-solver/get-started) mostra esempi end-to-end che modellano i problemi con [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper) e, facoltativamente, Open Mathematical prograMming eXchange (OMMX). [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) è un formato di dati aperto e un SDK che semplifica lo scambio di problemi di ottimizzazione tra strumenti software.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description {#description}"
msgstr "Descrizione {#description}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver implements the Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) and surrounds it with classical preprocessing and postprocessing. This section explains the SQOA framework and how it differs from the Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA).\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver implementa il Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) e lo circonda con pre-elaborazione e post-elaborazione classiche. Questa sezione spiega il framework SQOA e in cosa si differenzia dal Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
